WEBVTT

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:05.660
Across every sector, including healthcare, finance, education, and law,

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:08.930
organisations are deploying AI faster than they can govern it.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.370
The technology moves. The accountability structures do not.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.420
That gap between what AI promises and what it costs

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.470
is what this presentation is about.
